---
const title = "Entrar";
import loginScript from "../scripts/login.ts?url";
---

<html lang="pt-BR">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #eef4ff;
        --surface: #ffffff;
        --surface-soft: #f8fafc;
        --border: #dbe4f0;
        --text: #0f172a;
        --muted: #64748b;
        --primary: #1d4ed8;
        --primary-dark: #1e40af;
        --danger: #dc2626;
        --success: #15803d;
      }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        font-family: Inter, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
        color: var(--text);
        background:
          radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.18), transparent 28%),
          radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.16), transparent 24%),
          linear-gradient(180deg, #f7fbff 0%, #edf3ff 100%);
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        padding: 24px;
      }
      .auth-shell {
        width: min(1040px, 100%);
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
        border-radius: 28px;
        overflow: hidden;
        background: var(--surface);
        box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
      }
      .auth-aside {
        padding: 40px;
        background:
          linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(29, 78, 216, 0.96), rgba(14, 116, 144, 0.88)),
          #1d4ed8;
        color: #eff6ff;
      }
      .auth-aside h1 { margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.1; }
      .auth-aside p { margin: 0; color: rgba(239, 246, 255, 0.9); max-width: 38ch; }
      .auth-highlights { margin-top: 28px; display: grid; gap: 14px; }
      .auth-highlight {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
        border-radius: 18px;
        padding: 16px 18px;
      }
      .auth-highlight strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; }
      .auth-panel { padding: 34px 32px; }
      .auth-tabs {
        display: inline-grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        background: var(--surface-soft);
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 4px;
        margin-bottom: 22px;
      }
      .auth-tab {
        border: none;
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--muted);
        padding: 10px 18px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .auth-tab.is-active {
        background: var(--surface);
        color: var(--text);
        box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
      }
      .auth-form {
        display: none;
        gap: 14px;
      }
      .auth-form.is-active {
        display: grid;
      }
      .auth-form h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; }
      .auth-form p { margin: 0 0 6px; color: var(--muted); }
      label { display: grid; gap: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; }
      input {
        width: 100%;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 13px 14px;
        font: inherit;
      }
      input:focus {
        outline: 2px solid rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.22);
        border-color: var(--primary);
      }
      .auth-actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .auth-button {
        border: none;
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 13px 18px;
        background: var(--primary);
        color: white;
        font-weight: 700;
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      .auth-button:hover { background: var(--primary-dark); }
      .auth-button:disabled {
        opacity: 0.7;
        cursor: wait;
      }
      .auth-button--ghost {
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--primary);
        border: 1px solid rgba(29, 78, 216, 0.2);
      }
      .auth-message {
        min-height: 48px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 12px 14px;
        font-size: 14px;
        display: none;
      }
      .auth-message.is-visible { display: block; }
      .auth-message.is-error { background: #fff1f2; color: var(--danger); }
      .auth-message.is-success { background: #ecfdf5; color: var(--success); }
      .auth-footer { margin-top: 18px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
      .auth-footer a { color: var(--primary); font-weight: 600; }
      @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .auth-shell { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .auth-aside, .auth-panel { padding: 24px; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <section class="auth-shell">
      <aside class="auth-aside">
        <h1>Fiscal Platform</h1>
        <p>
          Entre com sua conta para acessar organizacoes, importar notas e alimentar a dashboard
          com dados reais do ambiente.
        </p>
        <div class="auth-highlights">
          <div class="auth-highlight">
            <strong>1. Autentique</strong>
            <span>O token da API e salvo no navegador para as rotas protegidas.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="auth-highlight">
            <strong>2. Escolha a organizacao</strong>
            <span>Depois do login, selecione a empresa ativa para consultar invoices.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="auth-highlight">
            <strong>3. Volte para a dashboard</strong>
            <span>Com sessao e organizacao definidas, os cards passam a ler dados reais.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <main class="auth-panel">
        <div class="auth-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Autenticacao">
          <a class="auth-tab is-active" href="#login-form" data-target="login-form" aria-selected="true">
            Entrar
          </a>
          <a class="auth-tab" href="#register-form" data-target="register-form" aria-selected="false">
            Cadastrar
          </a>
        </div>

        <div id="auth-message" class="auth-message" aria-live="polite"></div>

        <form id="login-form" class="auth-form is-active" novalidate>
          <h2>Acessar conta</h2>
          <p>Use o email e a senha cadastrados para gerar o token de acesso.</p>
          <label>
            Email
            <input id="login-email" type="email" placeholder="voce@empresa.com" autocomplete="email" required />
          </label>
          <label>
            Senha
            <input id="login-password" type="password" placeholder="Sua senha" autocomplete="current-password" required />
          </label>
          <div class="auth-actions">
            <button class="auth-button" type="submit" id="login-submit">Entrar</button>
            <a class="auth-button auth-button--ghost" href="/">Voltar para a dashboard</a>
          </div>
        </form>

        <form id="register-form" class="auth-form" novalidate>
          <h2>Criar conta</h2>
          <p>Cadastre um usuario novo para comecar a usar o ambiente local.</p>
          <label>
            Nome
            <input id="register-name" type="text" placeholder="Nome do responsavel" autocomplete="name" required />
          </label>
          <label>
            Email
            <input id="register-email" type="email" placeholder="voce@empresa.com" autocomplete="email" required />
          </label>
          <label>
            Senha
            <input
              id="register-password"
              type="password"
              placeholder="Minimo de 6 caracteres"
              autocomplete="new-password"
              minlength="6"
              required
            />
          </label>
          <label>
            Confirmar senha
            <input
              id="register-password-confirm"
              type="password"
              placeholder="Repita a senha"
              autocomplete="new-password"
              minlength="6"
              required
            />
          </label>
          <div class="auth-actions">
            <button class="auth-button" type="submit" id="register-submit">Criar conta</button>
            <button class="auth-button auth-button--ghost" type="button" id="switch-to-login">
              Ja tenho conta
            </button>
          </div>
        </form>

        <p class="auth-footer">
          Depois do login, siga para <a href="/organizations">Organizacoes</a> para definir o
          contexto ativo da dashboard.
        </p>
      </main>
    </section>

    <script type="module" src={loginScript}></script>
  </body>
</html>
